sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    box rgb(238,248,242) GUI thread
        participant D as SettingsDialog
        participant S as ImageSettingsController
        participant V as PhiViewModel<br/>(preview and shape overlay)
    end
    box rgb(244,245,255) Preview thread
        participant P as ImagePreviewWorker
    end

    Note over D,S: Changing a filter or the downscale

    D->>S: updateEditedConfig(downscale, filters)
    S->>S: new request identifier
    S-->>D: processingStarted
    Note over D: the time shows "..."
    S-)P: submit(id, image, parameters)
    Note over S,P: queued command: only the latest request is kept,<br/>the older ones are dropped

    P->>P: downscale, then filters
    P-->>S: previewReady(id, images, filter time)

    alt id is the latest request
        S->>V: setBackground(filtered image)
        S-->>D: filterPipelineProcessed(time)
    else outdated result
        S->>S: ignore it, a newer one follows
    end

    Note over D,V: Editing the initial shape stays in the GUI thread
    D->>S: addShape or subtractShape
    S->>V: update the phi mask and its overlay
